          "bytes": 2499
        }
      ],
      "example": "The two profile-meaning records use Definition/v1. Their admission material must satisfy the current v1 route without assuming an unadopted v2 profile or silently installing a mixed candidate schema."
    },
    {
      "id": "COMP-02",
      "title": "Admit profile meanings under the existing v1 route",
      "prepared": "Both exact profile meanings and their fresh correspondence are reviewed within stated limits.",
      "remaining": "V1 checks 01-06 must PASS on the selected exact package; check 07 must be NOT_EVALUABLE solely because owner selection is pending. Actual exact semantic admission and applicable application remain absent.",
      "owners": [
        "role:definition-owner"
      ],
      "source": [
        {
