          "selector": "/nodes/0"
        }
      ],
      "example": "An admitted Evaluation Profile meaning may define what a profile is; that effect alone does not register or adopt evaluation-profile/v2."
    },
    {
      "id": "COMP-03",
      "title": "Qualify exact mechanics and register profile/v2 types",
      "prepared": "Exact closed schema, generator, descriptor sources and structural witnesses are captured.",
      "remaining": "Mechanics effect and two type-registration effects need separately qualified owner scope, exact admitted semantic bindings and applicable application evidence.",
