    {
      "id": "COMP-06",
      "title": "Qualify Pack and Define separately for semantic admission",
      "prepared": "Both exact meanings, source/voice correspondence, cohort and preservation dispositions are reviewed.",
      "remaining": "Checks 01-12 must PASS under applicable adopted contracts; check 13 is pending solely because no admission was selected; check 14 is excluded before application. Actual per-subject owner selection and confirmed application remain separate.",
