    {
      "id": "COMP-07",
      "title": "One coherent authorized visibility effect and derivative mirrors",
      "prepared": "The prospective immutable-cohort/final-lookup recipe and nine exact live preconditions are captured and still match.",
      "remaining": "Actual qualified effects, generated applied outputs and authorized Project State/application evidence must precede one coherent final visibility commit. Staged effects cannot be relabeled effective without their required evidence. Derivative workspace mirrors follow the selected epoch.",
