    {
      "id": "COMP-08",
      "title": "Prove owner authority covers each exact role, subject and effect",
      "prepared": "Admitted owner-route evidence is captured; several roles are assigned to the same recorded principal with required decision separation.",
      "remaining": "Verify applicable scope for these exact carrier versions and effects. The captured type-owner assignment mentions Artifact Type/v1/registered-binding scope; no broader v2 effect scope is inferred. Where insufficient, explicit qualified scope authority is required before that effect.",
