      "example": "One person may separately decide the semantic meaning, mechanics, type registration and profile adoption. One scoped acceptance does not collapse those decisions or appoint another role."
    },
    {
      "id": "COMP-09",
      "title": "Actual Decisions, applied output metadata and fresh eligibility evidence",
      "prepared": "Candidate bytes and recipes are exact; future Decisions/application receipts remain null.",
      "remaining": "Use real qualified Decision/effect identities, exact source/input hashes and prerequisite-specific evaluation evidence. Generate and verify applied outputs against those actual inputs; do not substitute conversational review records or fabricate future IDs. Changed selected input/precondition bytes reopen affected checks.",
