          "selector": "/invalidation"
        }
      ],
      "example": "The pending-decision exception is valid only when all prerequisite checks already pass; an unadopted profile is an additional blocker, not merely a missing owner decision."
    },
    {
      "id": "COMP-10",
      "title": "Retain bounded assurance and separate runtime work",
      "prepared": "Finite model/source/preservation evidence and 17 registered limits are retained.",
      "remaining": "No whole-repository theorem or runtime conformance is established. E05 strict provider/exporter, actual enforcement and temporal/storage qualification remain separate work; final governing contracts must retain explicit claim ceilings.",
